From macro at linux-mips.org  Fri Sep  4 22:04:00 2009
From: macro at linux-mips.org (Maciej W. Rozycki)
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2009 23:04:00 +0100 (BST)
Subject: [RFC] Dropping Alpha sparse mapping support from X
